// Q-083 A service's `schedule` never runs while the service shares the app's process (one process, the default): its jobs run only when it is run alone or split
// mode: serve
// get: /s/runs
// open-when: "runs":0
// fixed-when: /"runs":[1-9]/
// From FEEDBACK12.md §Q-083 (found on 6887b0b). `quillo check` passes it; s.qwe run alone runs its job.

service /s = "s.qwe"

route GET / = "the app"
